sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Grove caller
  participant R as Ravel
  participant A as Grove caller policy assets
  participant P as Producer session
  participant V as Review session
  G->>R: Producer kind, task file, handle and prompt
  R->>A: Owner explicitly imports provenance wrapper
  A->>A: Capture selected provider in canonical receipt
  A-->>R: Wrapped selected command
  R->>P: Managed process receives GROVE_PROVIDER_EVIDENCE
  P->>P: Finish producer, name own receipt on live reviews of producer and closed nodes
  Note over P: Missing evidence clears earlier Creator, owner declaration required<br/>Invalid evidence stops for repair, unfinished attempt writes nothing
  P->>P: Retire and commit task plus review Creator record
  P->>R: Prompt's exact end-session grove-continue
  R-->>G: Opaque result after cleanup
  G->>R: Review kind, committed review task and prompt
  R->>A: Read Reviews and Creator through generic measured reads
  A->>A: Validate receipt/declaration, enforce owner's provider rule
  alt Valid creator evidence and different-provider route
    A-->>R: Selected reviewer command, optionally wrapped with its own receipt
    R->>V: Start and supervise reviewer
  else Missing, invalid, legacy or unsupported creator/route
    A-->>R: Refusal with remedy
    R-->>G: Nonzero status, nothing launched
  end
  Note over G,V: Receipt association is same-user attestation, no persistent Ravel lookup
